@startuml "Chain of Responsibility - Expense (List) - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title The chain kept as a list: the list holds the order, and the loop does the passing
class ApprovalChain {
  - links : List<Link>
  + then(Link) : ApprovalChain
  + handle(Expense) : String
}
interface Link <<Handler>> {
  + tryToHandle(Expense) : String
}
class Approver <<ConcreteHandler>> {
  - name : String
  - limit : int
}
class AuditLog <<ConcreteHandler>>
ApprovalChain o--> "*" Link : links
Link <|.. Approver
Link <|.. AuditLog
note bottom of Approver
  No field for
  the next handler.
end note
@enduml
